liblc3

src/*.c, src/*.h, include/lc3.h, include/lc3_private.h and LICENSE are unmodified files of liblc3 1.1.3
(https://github.com/google/liblc3, tag v1.1.3, tarball
https://github.com/google/liblc3/archive/refs/tags/v1.1.3.tar.gz, SHA-256
276752ff54ce6a77d54ec133397b9d7e71f90caf3d9afa32d8b0e891b8ecb8af). The rest of the release (its build
files, include/lc3_cpp.h and its other directories) is left out.

Copyright 2022 Google LLC. Apache License, Version 2.0 (LICENSE). The release has no NOTICE file.

Built with LC3_PLUS=0 and LC3_PLUS_HR=0: the g1v0 firmware's microphone encoder (g1_firmware/firmware),
the C++ library's decoder (SCOUTER_G1_MIC) and the emulated arms' encoder; go/internal/lc3 and
python/build.sh compile these files in place.
